WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:21.114
I was almost four years old when Farmer Grey brought another man to see me.

2
00:00:21.414 --> 00:00:22.555
It was Squire Gordon.

3
00:00:22.575 --> 00:00:27.598
"What a fine-looking horse," the squire said, gazing at me.

4
00:00:28.799 --> 00:00:30.880
Indeed I was growing up to be very handsome.

5
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.822
I was jet-black except for one white hoof and a white star on my forehead.

6
00:00:35.842 --> 00:00:40.184
"I'll start training him soon," Farmer Grey said.

7
00:00:40.204 --> 00:00:44.005
"I like to let horses grow up before I ride them.

8
00:00:44.465 --> 00:00:46.146
Boys should not work like men."

9
00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:50.768
Squire Gordon chuckled, and then looked into my eyes.

10
00:00:51.928 --> 00:00:56.350
He gently opened my mouth to examine my teeth, and ran his hands up and down my legs.

11
00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:59.412
"May I see how he moves?"

12
00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:00.312
he asked.

13
00:01:01.588 --> 00:01:03.469
"Of course," Farmer Grey replied.

14
00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:07.692
I walked, trotted, and cantered while the two men watched.

15
00:01:13.555 --> 00:01:15.736
When I finished, the squire looked pleased.

16
00:01:15.756 --> 00:01:19.218
"Please call me when he's trained," he said.

17
00:01:19.238 --> 00:01:21.860
"This horse is exactly what I'm looking for."

18
00:01:24.381 --> 00:01:26.042
The next day I began my training.

19
00:01:27.323 --> 00:01:29.144
I already knew how to do lots of things.

20
00:01:30.344 --> 00:01:32.866
I could wear a halter and walk calmly beside a human.

21
00:01:34.247 --> 00:01:36.869
I could pick up my feet nicely so my hooves could be trimmed.

22
00:01:37.909 --> 00:01:40.051
But now I found there was much more to learn!

23
00:01:41.512 --> 00:01:44.634
First came the bridle, which looked a little like a halter.

24
00:01:45.575 --> 00:01:47.857
But there was one big difference: the bit.

25
00:01:48.777 --> 00:01:51.219
That was a piece of metal attached to the leather straps.

26
00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:55.542
Imagine my surprise when Farmer Grey put the bit into my mouth!

27
00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:58.184
I tried to spit it right back out.

28
00:01:59.728 --> 00:02:03.590
But Farmer Grey used kind words and some grain to convince me not to do so.

29
00:02:05.531 --> 00:02:08.773
Still, having the bit in my mouth was a very strange feeling.

30
00:02:09.593 --> 00:02:10.714
I did not like it at all!

31
00:02:11.814 --> 00:02:14.415
Next Farmer Grey set a saddle gently on my back.

32
00:02:15.816 --> 00:02:19.158
There was a strap that he fastened under my body to hold the saddle in place.

33
00:02:20.278 --> 00:02:23.580
I didn't mind that too much—especially when he gave me more grain.

34
00:02:25.696 --> 00:02:29.478
After that Farmer Grey saddled and bridled me every day and led me around.

35
00:02:32.499 --> 00:02:36.321
He also gave me extra grain, along with lots of pats and kind words.

36
00:02:37.642 --> 00:02:40.323
Before long I looked forward to my training sessions.

37
00:02:41.444 --> 00:02:44.965
Then one day Farmer Grey lifted himself into the saddle and sat on my back.

38
00:02:46.106 --> 00:02:50.508
It felt strange, but I could hear his voice talking to me from up there, so I wasn't

39
00:02:50.548 --> 00:02:55.242
afraid. Soon Farmer Grey was riding me around the farm every day.

40
00:02:56.984 --> 00:02:58.585
Then he brought out a driving harness.

41
00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:04.210
My mother and the other adult horses wore this harness whenever they were hooked to a cart or

42
00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:10.354
carriage. The harness had a stiff, heavy collar and a bridle with two squares of leather, called blinkers,

43
00:03:10.575 --> 00:03:11.215
attached to it.

44
00:03:12.576 --> 00:03:16.299
With the blinkers on, I could see straight ahead, but not to the sides.

45
00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:21.864
More harness pieces crossed my body, and a stiff strap went under my tail.

46
00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:26.401
The tail strap was called a crupper, and I liked it even less than the bit.

47
00:03:27.381 --> 00:03:30.862
The first time Farmer Grey put the crupper on me, I felt like kicking.

48
00:03:31.883 --> 00:03:34.983
But my mother had taught me well, and I kept my feet on the ground.

49
00:03:36.424 --> 00:03:38.885
I almost forgot to mention one more part of my training.

50
00:03:40.585 --> 00:03:43.186
My master sent me to a nearby farm for a couple of weeks.

51
00:03:44.306 --> 00:03:46.867
I was put out in a field with some sheep and cows.

52
00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:50.848
There was plenty of delicious grass, so I started to eat.

53
00:03:51.788 --> 00:03:53.349
Then I heard a roar in the distance.

54
00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:58.253
Seconds later a huge, noisy black monster rushed into view!

55
00:03:59.314 --> 00:04:02.456
It terrified me so much that I galloped to the far end of the field.

56
00:04:03.537 --> 00:04:06.919
To my surprise, though, the sheep and cows didn't react at all!

57
00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:10.582
I soon found out that the monster was called a train.

58
00:04:11.702 --> 00:04:14.705
And I learned why none of the other animals seemed to notice the noise.

59
00:04:16.266 --> 00:04:19.008
Trains raced past that field several times every day.

60
00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:21.721
At first I ran away each time.

61
00:04:23.002 --> 00:04:25.824
Then I stopped running and just lifted my head to watch.

62
00:04:28.926 --> 00:04:33.669
Finally I got used to the trains, just as I'd grown used to the bit, the saddle, the

63
00:04:33.729 --> 00:04:35.331
harness, and even the crupper.

64
00:04:36.952 --> 00:04:41.835
I returned home, and Farmer Grey started hooking me to a cart and driving me around the neighborhood.

65
00:04:42.856 --> 00:04:44.657
He usually hitched my mother beside me.

66
00:04:45.738 --> 00:04:48.960
She was a good, calm horse who helped to teach me what to do.

67
00:04:49.964 --> 00:04:52.545
"You're learning fast, my son," she told me.

68
00:04:52.565 --> 00:04:57.127
"I'm glad because the better you behave, the better humans will treat you."

69
00:04:58.588 --> 00:04:59.308
"What do you mean?"

70
00:04:59.708 --> 00:05:00.269
I asked her.

71
00:05:00.289 --> 00:05:03.550
"Farmer Grey always treats all the horses well."

72
00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.971
"Yes," she agreed.

73
00:05:05.991 --> 00:05:09.573
"But other humans aren't always as kind as our master."

74
00:05:10.613 --> 00:05:13.815
I wasn't sure why I should worry about what other humans were like.

75
00:05:14.875 --> 00:05:16.956
But later I would find out more about that.
